<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan housing starts down 1.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan housing starts down 1.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts fell 1.9 percent in January from a year earlier to 105,375 units, the Construction Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>It was the first year-on-year decline in 11 months, it said in a statement  </p>
<p>				    Jan starts   yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes			40,130	   +2.3</p>
<p> Rental homes			 39,571	   -5.6</p>
<p> Employee housing		    1,689	  -18.1</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	   23,985	   -0.9</p>
<p> Total				 105,375	   -1.9</p>
</text>
